    "items": [
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "integrity",
        "body": "There's no point in doing a job unless you're going to do it right. We believe in adherence to proper guidelines that allow us to do exactly that. Being honest and hard-working are values we believe aid in our integrity."
      },
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "communication",
        "body": "Our entire business is founded in our ability to help people communicate quickly, efficiently, and effectively. We carry this ethos with us through every project we work on, from beginning to end."
      },
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "teamwork",
        "body": "Without the people who support our day-to-day operations, we wouldn't be where we are. We prioritize teamwork in all that we do. That's why we're 100% employee-owned, and why we'll stay that way for years to come."
      },
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "quality",
        "body": "Just because we live in a digital age doesn't mean you can't produce quality work. Renkim strives every day to deliver results that both match the speed of the modern era, while also remaining of the highest possible quality."
      },
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "empathy",
        "body": "Part of any good business is the desire to want to understand people. We want to know where you're coming from and why, not just because it's part of our job, but because we believe that's a simple courtesy you deserve."
      },
      {
        "eyebrow": "we value",
        "title": "respect",
        "body": "Without mutual respect, any relationship is destined to fall apart. Renkim works every day to maintain the respect of our clients and our colleagues, and we believe the results of our efforts speak for themselves."
      }
    ],
